<aside class="writing-tool-panel writing-revisions" data-editor-revisions aria-hidden="true" inert>
  <header>
    <div>
      <p>版本历史</p>
      <span>本地修订记录</span>
    </div>
    <button type="button" data-editor-revisions-close aria-label="关闭版本历史">关闭</button>
  </header>

  <div class="writing-revisions__create">
    <label>
      <span>本次修改说明</span>
      <input type="text" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如：调整第二节结构" data-editor-revision-note />
    </label>
    <button type="button" data-editor-revision-create>保存当前版本</button>
  </div>

  <p class="writing-tool-panel__status" data-editor-revision-status aria-live="polite">
    重要保存会形成可恢复的本地版本。
  </p>
  <ol class="writing-revisions__list" data-editor-revision-list></ol>

  <section class="writing-revisions__compare" data-editor-revision-compare hidden>
    <header>
      <p>版本比较</p>
      <button type="button" data-editor-revision-compare-close>收起比较</button>
    </header>
    <p data-editor-revision-compare-summary></p>
    <pre data-editor-revision-compare-preview></pre>
  </section>

  <p class="writing-tool-panel__boundary">
    修订内容保存在当前浏览器。未来接入账户与服务器后，
    RevisionRepository 会改为受身份验证的远程实现，编辑器交互无需重写。
  </p>
</aside>
